<title>USA: TABLE - Tractor Supply Co Q2 net shr down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Tractor Supply Co Q2 net shr down.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					    SECOND QUARTER ENDED</p>
<p>					June 28, 1997     June 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales			 $159,493	   $146,717</p>
<p> Cost of merchandise sold	118,234	    108,920</p>
<p>   Gross margin		     41,259	     37,797</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses	 28,005	     23,247</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization   1,105		  852</p>
<p>   Income from operations	 12,149	     13,698</p>
<p> Interest expense, net		 490		  566</p>
<p>   Income before income taxes   11,659	     13,132</p>
<p> Income tax provision		4,671		5,264</p>
<p>   Net income			  6,988		7,868</p>
<p>   Net income per share		.80		  .90</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding (000s)		 8,723		8,718</p>
<p>						  SIX MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>					June 28, 1997     June 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales			 $255,902	   $227,874</p>
<p> Cost of merchandise sold	190,490	    169,515</p>
<p>   Gross margin		     65,412	     58,359</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expenses	 52,094	     44,010</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization   2,133		1,589</p>
<p>   Income from operations	 11,185	     12,760</p>
<p> Interest expense, net	     1,070		1,235</p>
<p>   Income before income taxes   10,115	     11,525</p>
<p> Income tax provision		4,053		4,621</p>
<p>   Net income			  6,062		6,904</p>
<p>   Net income per share		.69		  .78</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding (000s)		 8,722		8,718</p>
<p>NOTE - Q2 1997 shr includes a reserve for management reorganization costs totaling about $1.2 million pretax, or about $700,000 net of tax.</p>
<p>Excluding the effect of the reserve for management reorganization costs, net income for the second quarter of fiscal 1997 would have been about $7.7 million, or about $0.88 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
